[deferred.accelerator-gate]
summary = "Coprocessor acceleration layer PARKED — depends on the unpublished AcceleratorGate.jl"
detail = """
src/backends/abstract.jl, src/coprocessors/*.jl and ext/Cliometrics*Ext.jl are
written against the AcceleratorGate.jl shared coprocessor-dispatch API. That
package is not yet published/registered: its Project.toml UUID
(59f742c7-270d-4a76-95d4-a853ae16cc71) and the per-accelerator [weakdeps] UUIDs
(TPUCompute 1111..., NPUAccel 2222..., DSPLibs 3333..., FPGASynthesis 4444...,
VPURuntime 5555..., QPUInterface 6666..., PPUCompute 7777..., MathAccel 8888...,
CryptoAccel 9999...) were placeholders, so Pkg.instantiate() could never resolve
them and CI failed before running any tests.
"""
action = """
Removed the AcceleratorGate [deps] entry, the [weakdeps]/[extensions] tables and
the [compat] pin from Project.toml, plus the unconditional include(...) calls in
src/Cliometrics.jl, so the core package instantiates and the 124 tests run
cleanly. The accelerator source is retained in-tree, unmodified, to be re-wired.
"""
blocked-on = "Publication/registration of AcceleratorGate.jl (shared estate dependency; same placeholder pattern fixed in Causals.jl#19)"
re-wire = "Restore the AcceleratorGate dep + [weakdeps]/[extensions] + the include block once AcceleratorGate is a real package."
